<no>3</no><heading guid="_375cb6fe-bc39-486c-be98-0b1ddb6b6cba"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Interpretation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_06dbf20a-c747-4a43-9585-75efca98a4ae"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_b1e584f6-9e06-43fd-891c-3957645ea23b"
id="sec.3-def.BlueScope"><b><i>BlueScope</i></b></defterm> means BlueScope
Steel Limited (ABN 16 000 011 058).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_682ed6bb-9cbe-480a-97db-708691586e74"
id="sec.3-def.BlueScopeTaxpayerEntity"><b><i>BlueScope Taxpayer
Entity</i></b></defterm> has the meaning it has in the deed.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_dbf627b9-d2ab-40ba-a50d-6828a3256860"
id="sec.3-def.deed"><b><i>deed</i></b></defterm> means the deed entitled
&#8220;Payroll Tax Structured Payment Plan Deed&#8221; set out in the tabled
text.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_60bef9f3-f081-413e-93fb-5a4176e352c5"
id="sec.3-def.function"><b><i>function</i></b></defterm> includes a power,
authority or duty, and <defterm type="definition"
guid="_a4950e40-68a4-47ea-a35c-fb74089d52e8"
id="sec.3-def.exercise"><b><i>exercise</i></b></defterm> a function includes
perform a duty.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a9d4a61f-2a7c-4f71-b436-b7f3b4d2c4ea"
id="sec.3-def.tabledtext"><b><i>tabled text</i></b></defterm> means the text
of the proposed deed entitled &#8220;Payroll Tax Structured Payment Plan
Deed&#8221;, a copy of which was tabled in Parliament on the date of
introduction of the Bill for the <legref refid="act-2015-068" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Deferral
(BlueScope Steel) Act 2015</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_42d606f5-66dd-43d8-adf3-af84de40395c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Other expressions used in this Act have the same
meaning as they have in the <legref refid="act-2007-021" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Act
2007</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ddf6ada8-34af-4200-8064-160e1194b3a5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c4ac255d-c50c-4572-ad08-348f87e919b9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_439f0e0a-04b6-4fa5-a94e-476792d5a862"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Relationship to <legref refid="act-2007-021" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Act
2007</i></name></legref> and <legref refid="act-1996-097" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Taxation Administration Act
1996</i></name></legref></b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_444217c5-d2ee-432f-8607-77f809e8696e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is to be read together with the <legref
refid="act-2007-021" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Act 2007</i></name></legref> and the <legref
refid="act-1996-097" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Taxation Administration Act
1996</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_c7704381-42d9-455a-966f-97c17289eb0d"
id="sec.4-ssec.1-note"><heading guid="_0e788ec6-0d89-4963-8d55-d222af44ef05"
id="sec.4-ssec.1-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref refid="act-1996-097" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Taxation Administration Act
1996</i></name></legref> makes provision for the administration and
enforcement of taxation laws. This Act is a taxation law for the purposes of
that Act.</txt></block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_946d851c-929a-4f0b-b51f-65b7effc8eaa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act sets out provisions that, for the
purposes of the <legref refid="act-2007-021" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Act
2007</i></name></legref>, apply only in this
jurisdiction.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b8533990-1b02-4b86-baaf-fe8f0a7f8b82"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_593f2ac9-b847-483b-beb3-d24d051df04f"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Authorisation of payroll tax deferral
arrangements</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_57ce1539-8209-4d52-9f34-3765a1c207b0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer is authorised, on behalf of the
State, to enter into and give effect to the deed.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cb71dd14-2a1f-4cd4-b307-5204e9cad246"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The deed may be given effect despite sections 7,
8 and 9 of the <legref refid="act-2007-021" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Act
2007</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6c23e4e8-bb69-4f78-85cb-409d60066a37"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_cb6b15e4-5e7e-4743-ae66-42ce56d2b537"
id="sec.5-def.givingeffectto"><b><i>giving effect to</i></b></defterm> the
deed includes:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4da004e8-7c67-4314-836b-633fbaa1970a" id="sec.5-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">complying with any obligation of the State under
the deed, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4fbbf30e-c035-45ef-9dd0-5cebda96449c" id="sec.5-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">exercising or enforcing any right or power under
the deed.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_56813244-4c22-4a3e-abe6-7bb7ac892d41"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purpose of giving effect to the deed,
section 81 (1) of the <legref refid="act-2007-021" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Act
2007</i></name></legref> is to be read as if the reference to an amount that a
member of a group is required to pay under that Act in respect of a period
were a reference to an amount that a BlueScope Taxpayer Entity is required to
pay under the deed.</txt></block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_faae606b-245b-4fbf-a76c-ba4db9120c8f"
id="sec.5-ssec.4-note"><heading guid="_602c4c96-384f-4cd8-8e37-e27b036ebc59"
id="sec.5-ssec.4-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The BlueScope Taxpayer Entities are a group under
the <legref refid="act-2007-021" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Act
2007</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cffb3ad6-e64f-4fe4-9d5c-c43fe4cc2463"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section has effect despite anything to the
contrary in the <legref refid="act-2007-021" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Payroll Tax Act
2007</i></name></legref> or any other law.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dd30586f-fc62-4225-b2b1-ca6b4a3617dd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this section limits or prevents the
exercise of any function by the Chief Commissioner under section 37 or 47 of
the <legref refid="act-1996-097" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Taxation Administration Act 1996</i></name></legref> in
relation to payroll tax payable by BlueScope and any BlueScope Taxpayer
Entity.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_aa2a0c00-80a8-4088-af21-de42874f63cc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(7)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A failure by BlueScope or a BlueScope Taxpayer
Entity to pay an amount required to be paid by it under the deed is a tax
default for the purposes of the <legref refid="act-1996-097" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Taxation Administration Act
1996</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b5febfa8-f8b9-4ebf-9970-b18ee755429d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_8c1cf9a4-b843-4340-956e-3e783362fc8c"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Evidence</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e94fdcf3-1242-461c-a122-52d372923913"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A certificate of the Clerk of the Legislative
Assembly certifying that a document is an accurate copy of the tabled text, or
is an accurate copy of a particular part or of particular provisions of the
tabled text, is admissible in evidence in any proceedings and is
evidence:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3e9024f8-95bf-468c-87c6-973beecf19f3" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">of the matter certified, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8b24b7c2-f602-4038-836c-fc46fdbb6b56" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">that the text of the proposed deed was tabled in
the Legislative Assembly as referred to in the definition of <defterm
type="definition" guid="_46ce85b3-6fc4-4b98-a685-7bd73a0c5595"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-def.tabledtext"><b><i>tabled text</i></b></defterm> in
section 3.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a1ed247e-d96f-4073-b0fe-b93a6cd46260"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) does not affect any other way in
which the tabling or content of the tabled text, or the accuracy of a copy of
the tabled text or of a part or provisions of the tabled text, may be
established.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</content>


